{
  "file_id": "3540",
  "text_count": 167,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Waaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2187,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uuuuuuuuuaaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "T.K...",
      "_offset": 2212,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T.K..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "We got separated from Matt and\nthe others...waaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2222,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Nos separamos de Matt y de los\ndemás...uaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "At a time like this...if I were\nPiyomon... I could evolve and\nfly and get us back...",
      "_offset": 2278,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "En momentos así...si fuese\nPiyomon...Digievolucionaría\npara volar hacia ellos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Mattoooooo!",
      "_offset": 2363,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Maaaaattt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "But...why...why can't I evolve?\nWaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2377,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pero...no puedo digievolucionar!\nBuaaaahh!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "W-what's wrong? Patamon...",
      "_offset": 2421,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Q-Qué ocurre? Patamon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Because, because...if I could\nevolve, I could fly in the sky...!",
      "_offset": 2448,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Porque, porque... Si pudiera\ndigievolucionar, podría...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Huh...I wonder where Matt is...",
      "_offset": 2513,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uh...Me pregunto dónde está Matt."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I don't even know where we are\nnow...",
      "_offset": 2547,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No sé ni donde estamos ahora..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Where should we go?",
      "_offset": 2585,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A dónde vamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Doesn't matter... I'll go wherever\nyou go, T.K.",
      "_offset": 2605,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No importa...Iré a donde sea\ncontigo, T.K."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Okay, this way.",
      "_offset": 2656,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale, por aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 2672,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "...Wah! So pretty...!",
      "_offset": 2680,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...Oh! Qué bonito...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 2702,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Let's go in!",
      "_offset": 2710,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vayamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2723,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "T.K...! What's over there?",
      "_offset": 2729,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T.K! Qué hay ahí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "It's a cradle...",
      "_offset": 2759,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Una cuna..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "It's a village of newborn Digimon!",
      "_offset": 2776,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es un pueblo de Digimon bebé!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Why don't we try taking care of\nthem, T.K?",
      "_offset": 2811,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por qué no los cuidamos, T.K?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Should we? Help me out, Patamon!",
      "_offset": 2857,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Deberíamos? Ayúdame, Patamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 2890,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "*Bo, bo!*",
      "_offset": 2896,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bo, bo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "It's a Botamon! It's a Digimon\nbaby!",
      "_offset": 2906,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es un Botamon! Un bebé Digimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "How cuuuuuute! It's so fuzzy.",
      "_offset": 2943,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Que bonitooo! Es peludito."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "That's because it's a newborn!",
      "_offset": 2973,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eso es por ser recién nacido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "*Pu, pu!*",
      "_offset": 3004,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pu, pu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "This one's a Punimon!",
      "_offset": 3014,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Y este es Punimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Wow! It's going \"puni, puni\"!",
      "_offset": 3036,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Guau! Y dice \"puni puni\"!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "*Achoo! Achoo!*",
      "_offset": 3066,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Achú! Achú!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Haha! Is this a baby, too?\nIt looks like an old man with a\nbeard.",
      "_offset": 3082,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Jaja! Es un bebé, también?\nParece un señor mayor con barba."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Don't say things like that! It's a\nrespectable baby.",
      "_offset": 3148,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No digas esas cosas! Es un bebé\nrespetable!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "What's this?... There's a card\ninserted here.\n\"Rub me\", it says.",
      "_offset": 3201,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué es eso?... Hay una tarjeta.\nDice, \"Acaríciame\"."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Rub what?",
      "_offset": 3266,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "The DigiEgg, right?",
      "_offset": 3276,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El DigiHuevo, no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "All right, wanna try it?",
      "_offset": 3296,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale, probamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Okay...rub, rub...one more time,\nrub, rub...",
      "_offset": 3321,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale...así, así... un poco más,\nasí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "*Po, po!*",
      "_offset": 3366,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Po, po!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It's hatched!",
      "_offset": 3376,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Se abrió!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Yay!",
      "_offset": 3390,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Ah, but there's no cradle for this\none...",
      "_offset": 3395,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ah, pero este no tiene una\ncuna..."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Hm...is there an extra one\nanywhere...?",
      "_offset": 3437,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Hm...habrá alguna de sobra?"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Hey, you!",
      "_offset": 3477,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh, tú!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "H-huh?",
      "_offset": 3487,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ehh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Who's there?",
      "_offset": 3494,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Quién va?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "How dare you coddle my beloved\nbabies!",
      "_offset": 3507,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Cómo te atreves a mimar a mis\nbebés!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "What's wrong with coddling them?",
      "_offset": 3546,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué tiene de malo mimarlos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "That's because... \"coddling\" can\nalso mean something like\n\"bullying\"!",
      "_offset": 3579,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Porque... \"mimar\" puede ser...\n\"maltratar\"!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "That's weird!",
      "_offset": 3649,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "...Whatever. Get ready!",
      "_offset": 3663,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...Da igual. Prepárate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "We won! Wanna go at it again?\nWe'll do it as much as you want.",
      "_offset": 3690,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ganamos! Quieres otra?\nPodemos estar así cuánto tiempo\nquieras!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Gh, looks like I misjudged you. A\ndefeat's a defeat. Welcome to the\nVillage of Beginnings.",
      "_offset": 3753,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Te he subestimado. Una derrota es\nuna derrota. Bienvenidos a la\nCiudad de los Bebés."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Good, good! I really don't like\nfighting.",
      "_offset": 3844,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bien, bien! No me gusta nada\nluchar."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "If kids fight, they make up pretty\nquickly, but adults...",
      "_offset": 3886,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si los niños se pelean, hacen\nlas paces. Los mayores..."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "T.K...?",
      "_offset": 3944,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T.K...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "You're stronger than you look.\nEven the smallest grain of pepper\ncan still prick the tongue, eh?",
      "_offset": 3955,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eres más fuerte de lo que\npareces. Hasta un grano de\npimienta puede picar, verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "By the way, do you know how we can\nget back up that mountain?",
      "_offset": 4052,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por cierto, sabes como podemos\nvolver a esa montaña?"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "You mean Monte Mugen?",
      "_offset": 4114,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El Monte Mugen?"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 4142,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I suggest you don't, because\nDevimon's there...",
      "_offset": 4148,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Te sugiero que no vayas, ahí\nestá Devimon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I have to ask Devimon where he's\ntaken Matt and the others.",
      "_offset": 4196,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tenemos que preguntarle dónde\nestán Matt y los otros."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "He's not the type to just listen\nquietly. No matter what you ask\nhim, you'll have to defeat him.",
      "_offset": 4258,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No es quién para atender esas\ncosas. Cómo sea, tendrás que\nderrotarle."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I don't want to fight!",
      "_offset": 4355,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No quiero luchar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I'm sure there must be another\nway.",
      "_offset": 4378,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Seguro que hay otro modo."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "I feel like something will\nhappen...if we join our hearts\ntogether...",
      "_offset": 4414,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Siento que algo ocurrirá...\nSi unimos nuestros corazones..."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Something will...\nhappen...?...Maybe...!",
      "_offset": 4484,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Algo... ocurrirá?\nQuizás...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Where are you going?",
      "_offset": 4528,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A donde vas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "To Gear Savannah, it's nearby!\nThere's a Yokomon village\nthere...",
      "_offset": 4549,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A Gear Savannah, está cerca!\nAllí hay un pueblo Yokomon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "The village that Meramon protects,\nright?",
      "_offset": 4616,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "EL pueblo protegido por Meramon,\nverdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I'm going to tell them what you\njust said! If our hearts unite, \nmaybe the island will recombine!",
      "_offset": 4658,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Le diré lo que me has dicho! Si\nnuestros corazones se unen,\nquizás la isla se una de nuevo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "The split pieces will come back...",
      "_offset": 4756,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Los trozos se vuelven a unir..."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "It's just a hunch...but I want to\nbelieve it!",
      "_offset": 4791,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es una corazonada... pero quiero\ncreer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Yeah! I'll believe in it, too!",
      "_offset": 4837,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si! Creeré en ello yo también!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Be careful!",
      "_offset": 4868,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Cuídate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "...Matt...",
      "_offset": 4880,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "*Waaah, waaaah!*",
      "_offset": 4893,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Buaaah, buaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 4910,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué ocurre?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Nice to meet you.",
      "_offset": 4924,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Encantado."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Whoa! It evolved!",
      "_offset": 4942,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uah! Evolucionó!"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Congrats!",
      "_offset": 4960,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Viva!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Congrats!",
      "_offset": 4970,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Viva!"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Congrats!",
      "_offset": 4980,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Viva!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "(Someday I'm going to evolve,\ntoo. But if I do, can I spend time\nlike this with T.K?)",
      "_offset": 4990,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "(Algún dia digievolucionaré. Pero\nsi lo hago, podré pasar tiempo\nde este modo con T.K.?"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Patamon? Do you want to evolve,\ntoo?",
      "_offset": 5079,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Patamon? Quieres Digievolucionar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "I'm fine like this! I'll stay like\nthis with you forever, T.K!",
      "_offset": 5116,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estoy bien así! Así estaré\ncontigo para siempre, T.K!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Okay, it's a promise! We'll be\nfriends forever!",
      "_offset": 5182,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale, es una promesa!\nAmigos para siempre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "we'll be friends forever!",
      "_offset": 5230,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Amigos para siempre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "we'll be friends forever!",
      "_offset": 5256,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Amigos para siempre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "...The Chosen Children...",
      "_offset": 5282,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...Los Niños Elegidos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Kill...the Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 5308,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Matar...los Niños Elegidos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "T.K! It's Leomon!",
      "_offset": 5336,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T.K! Es Leomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "_offset": 5357,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "T.K, over here!",
      "_offset": 5363,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T.K, por aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "With Leomon here...what are we\nsupposed to do?",
      "_offset": 5382,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Con Leomon aquí... qué debemos\nhacer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Leomon's normally a good Digimon,\nso we have to get the black gear's\npower out of him!",
      "_offset": 5429,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Leomon es normalmente un Digimon\nbueno, tenemos que sacarle esa\nrueda negra!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "But... how?",
      "_offset": 5516,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Y... cómo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Can you hear me, brats? You're\nscared and hiding, aren't you?\nCome out!",
      "_offset": 5528,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Me escucháis, idiotas! Estáis\nescondidos, no?\nSalid!"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Ogremon's here, too!",
      "_offset": 5600,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ogremon está aquí!"
